    --- `stackslots`, `upvalues`, `bytecodes`, `gcconsts`, `nconsts`,
    --- `children`, `isvararg`, `proto`, and `currentline` when `pc` is given.
    --- A builtin reports `ffid`, `addr` and `upvalues`, and nothing else.
    ---
